description	"B1-series Commander Battle Droid

Mass-produced, fragile combatants with superior rallying potential.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- E-5 Blaster Rifle (3)
- 1 Class-B Frag Grenade
-- 28% smaller splash
-- Primary fire only

^8Attributes:
- 2 Reinforcements
- 10% less knockback given
- 10% more knockback taken
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Close Combat Training (2)
- Rally
- Assemble (3)

Commanders were characterized by yellow-orange markings on the tops of their heads and circular spots on their abdomens. They received long-distance signals allowing them to be far from base with their squads, and reported directly to the Central Control Computer."